</sup> are spread [i.e., made public]","85":"when the records of deeds are spread open,","22":"When the scrolls are laid open;","203":"And when the (written) pages [of deeds (good and bad) of every person] are laid open."},"words":[{"id":11040,"position":1,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","translation":{"text":"And when","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"wa-idhā","language_name":"english"}},{"id":11041,"position":2,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلصُّحُفُ","translation":{"text":"the pages","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"l-ṣuḥufu","language_name":"english"}},{"id":11042,"position":3,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"نُشِرَتْ","translation":{"text":"are laid open","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"nushirat","language_name":"english"}}]},{"id":5811,"verse_number":11,"verse_key":"81:11","juz_number":30,"rub_el_hizb_number":234,"hizb_number":59,"ruku_number":525,"manzil_number":7,"sajdah_number":null,"page_number":586,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا ٱلسَّمَآءُ كُشِطَتْ","trs":{"20":"And when the sky is stripped away","85":"when the sky is stripped away,","22":"When the world on High is unveiled;","203":"And when the heaven is stripped off and taken away from its place;"},"words":[{"id":12988,"position":1,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","translation":{"text":"And when","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"wa-idhā","language_name":"english"}},{"id":12989,"position":2,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَآءُ","translation":{"text":"the sky","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"l-samāu","language_name":"english"}},{"id":12990,"position":3,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"كُشِطَتْ","translation":{"text":"is stripped away","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"kushiṭat","language_name":"english"}}]},{"id":5812,"verse_number":12,"verse_key":"81:12","juz_number":30,"rub_el_hizb_number":234,"hizb_number":59,"ru